label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">Refined</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">Forged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Stone\">$10/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$12/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$16/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.4.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Blueslate</b> is one of the 6 ore holding stone nodes that spawns on <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a>. They're found throughout the entire island except the Oke desert. These nodes spawn in a medium range of sizes. \n</p><p>Despite its name, the blueslate isn't blue, but instead takes on a lighter grey color. It uses the new slate material texture for its raw form. In both refined and forged versions of the stone, it maintains the same or similar color. \n</p>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_chart_below_displays_all_possible_ores_that_spawn_within_this_node.\">The chart below displays all possible ores that spawn within this node.</span></h5>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed fandom-table\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dc/Iron1.png/revision/latest?cb=20230823050155\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Iron1\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Iron1.png\" data-image-key=\"Iron1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dc/Iron1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20230823050155\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Iron\" title=\"Iron\">Iron</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d8/Gold1.png/revision/latest?cb=20230124105142\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Gold1\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gold1.png\" data-image-key=\"Gold1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d8/Gold1.png/revision/latest/scale-